  "worked_solution": "If we trace along the letters of the angle name, from $N$ to $R$ to $Q$, we can see the angle $∠NRQ.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131632/assets/59f393ac4418cf097587796d4227b472cc78693dd103dccd7dda8aa6088ccb3d.png)\n\nTherefore, $m∠NRQ={45}^{∘}.$",
